hi"},"can_ping":true,"can_manage_projects":true,"can_manage_people":true,"can_access_timesheet":false,"can_access_hill_charts":true},"description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cbc-attachment sgid=\"BAh7BkkiC19yYWlscwY6BkVUewdJIglkYXRhBjsAVEkiLmdpZDovL2JjMy9BdHRhY2htZW50LzgxMDk4OTc0MT9leHBpcmVzX2luBjsAVEkiCHB1cgY7AFRJIg9hdHRhY2hhYmxlBjsAVA==--b42a19534459820713e6fdb7fc14ec358f2e680d\" content-type=\"image/png\" url=\"https://preview.3.basecamp.com/3135399/blobs/c13e7cb0-00e4-11f1-bb78-0242ac120003/previews/full\" href=\"https://storage.3.basecamp.com/3135399/blobs/c13e7cb0-00e4-11f1-bb78-0242ac120003/download/image.png\" filename=\"image.png\" filesize=\"2998804\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" previewable=\"true\" presentation=\"gallery\" caption=\"UGC 广告中的“不完美真实感”\"\u003e\u003cfigure\u003e\n    \u003cimg srcset=\"https://preview.3.basecamp.com/3135399/blobs/c13e7cb0-00e4-11f1-bb78-0242ac120003/previews/full?dppx=2 2x, https://preview.3.basecamp.com/3135399/blobs/c13e7cb0-00e4-11f1-bb78-0242ac120003/previews/full?dppx=1 1x, https://preview.3.basecamp.com/3135399/blobs/c13e7cb0-00e4-11f1-bb78-0242ac120003/previews/full?dppx=3 3x, https://preview.3.basecamp.com/3135399/blobs/c13e7cb0-00e4-11f1-bb78-0242ac120003/previews/full?dppx=4 4x\" src=\"https://preview.3.basecamp.com/3135399/blobs/c13e7cb0-00e4-11f1-bb78-0242ac120003/previews/full\"\u003e\n  \u003cfigcaption\u003e\n    UGC 广告中的“不完美真实感”\n  \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\u003c/bc-attachment\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://chatgpt.com/c/69811c9a-c0f4-83a3-bb01-d731ea5ac67e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"\u003eGPT5 Pro\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e从一个 ChatGPT 动态开始\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e让 GPT agent mode 去找 10 篇内容， 类似seed mode扩散\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e让GPT Pro 成为 Alici AI 的主编和测试，选出三个主题\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch1\u003e主题 1：Lo‑Fi UGC Ads 制作指南\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFOR 作为芬兰品牌设计公司， 调性相当惊艳～\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e这篇什么是\u003ca href=\"https://for.co/blog/what-is-lo-fi-content-and-how-should-brands-approach-it\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"\u003e Lo-Fi 内容\u003c/a\u003e， 让我大开眼界\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e候选标题：\u003cstrong\u003eLo‑Fi UGC Ads Playbook：如何做出“不像广告”的 TikTok 风格 UGC 广告\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch1\u003e主题 2：Pratfall Effect 与“可控瑕疵”策略\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDentsu 这篇关于\u003ca href=\"https://www.dxglobal.com/insights/authenticity-the-irresistible-appeal-of-whats-not-perfect-beyond-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"\u003e真实性的博文\u003c/a\u003e，也抓的很好\u0026nbsp;\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e其中 提到 Intermarché 用“庆祝不完美蔬果”对抗浪费\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e候选标题：\u003cstrong\u003ePratfall Effect for UGC Ads：为什么“轻微瑕疵”让广告更可信？\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch1\u003e主题 3：AI 生成的 UGC 广告如何“做人味”\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e候选标题：Humanize AI UGC Ads：让 AI 生成视频更像真人 UGC 的 12 个“不完美细节”（避开 Uncanny Valley）\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","completed":false,"content":"🧵 如何制作不完美的真实感： GPT5 Pro 给出了三个选题， 感觉相当靠谱","starts_on":null,"due_on":null,"assignees":[],"completion_subscribers":[],"completion_url":"https://3.basecampapi.com/3135399/buckets/42744895/todos/9536996960/completion.json"},{"id":9541074504,"status":"active","visible_to_clients":false,"created_at":"2026-02-04T02:21:42.956Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T02:21:43.015Z","title":"新手教程：How to Create Viral AI UGC Ads in 2026: Best Practices for Beginners","inherits_status":true,"type":"Todo","url":"https://3.basecampapi.com/3135399/buckets/42744895/todos/9541074504.json","app_url":"https://3.basecamp.com/3135399/buckets/42744895/todos/9541074504","bookmark_url":"https://3.basecampapi.com/3135399/my/bookmarks/BAh7BkkiC19yYWlscwY6BkVUewdJIglkYXRhBjsAVEkiLmdpZDovL2JjMy9SZWNvcmRpbmcvOTU0MTA3NDUwND9leHBpcmVz